      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "For those idiots who don\u2019t realize that the instructions you were
    given are the wrong ones, and that the damn posters were put up incorrectly:
    the door in Block A cannot be opened using the \"Green-Red-Blue \u2013 1/1, 2/4,
    3/3\" sequence\u2014that\u2019s for the storage room on the second floor of Block
    A. Look at the poster by the elevator. And in case that piece of paper has been
    torn off again: for blue, it\u2019s 2/2. Don\u2019t just \"memorize\" this\u2014actually
    keep it in mind."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
