  m_text: "What kind of moron brought a green lamp here? We need blue ones. I hope
    they didn\u2019t end up in Block C again, near that noisy turret. Idiots see
    a poster there\u2014one that\u2019s actually supposed to be hung here\u2014and
    they just haul everything over to that spot. Up to the second floor of another
    section, right by that damn turret."
